<script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https:\/\/schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"1. How much does portrait photography cost in the UAE?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Pricing depends on session type, location, and package. Our packages are designed to suit individuals, families, and businesses at different budgets, with custom quotes available for corporate and group sessions."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"2. Do you offer both studio and outdoor portrait photography?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. We provide indoor sessions at our fully equipped studio as well as outdoor sessions across the UAE, including popular beach locations for a more natural, scenic look."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"3. How long does a typical portrait photoshoot take?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Most sessions run between 30 minutes and 2 hours, depending on whether it&#8217;s a single headshot, a family portrait, or a corporate portrait photography session involving multiple team members."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"4. When will I receive my edited photos?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Edited, high-resolution images are typically delivered within a few business days through an online gallery, with faster turnaround available on select packages."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"5. Can you photograph large teams for corporate portraits?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Absolutely. Our corporate portrait photographer team regularly handles group sessions for businesses across the UAE, ensuring consistent lighting, styling, and branding across every individual portrait."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"6. Do you travel across the UAE for on-location shoots?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes, we offer on-location portrait photography throughout the UAE, including offices, outdoor landmarks, and beach settings, in addition to sessions at our Dubai studio."}}]}</script>
